function return value:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("return", value)
function ignore value:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("discard", value)
function the negative of value:
    execute:
        return @intrinsic("negate", value)
flex section if condition:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("if", condition)
function the span from first to last:
    execute:
        if @intrinsic("greater than or equal", last, first):
            return @intrinsic("subtract", last, first)
        return the negative of (the span from last to first)
ignore the span from 1.0 to 0.0
